From: Jamal Tantaoui <jamal@tantaoui.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 16:03:46 +0100
Subject: Fix the expected output of the GHSA-g665-fm4p-vhff tests

Before 8.0, ldap_escape() reports a value that is too long with
zend_throw_exception(), as ValueError and zend_argument_value_error() do not
exist there, so the message has no "ldap_escape(): " prefix. These tests only
run on 32-bit builds.

(cherry picked from commit 458a1fd247f0fcb04e1129243125aa56a51ac648)
---
 ext/ldap/tests/GHSA-g665-fm4p-vhff-1.phpt | 4 ++--
 ext/ldap/tests/GHSA-g665-fm4p-vhff-2.phpt | 4 ++--
 2 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/ext/ldap/tests/GHSA-g665-fm4p-vhff-1.phpt b/ext/ldap/tests/GHSA-g665-fm4p-vhff-1.phpt
index 734bbe9..53844e0 100644
--- a/ext/ldap/tests/GHSA-g665-fm4p-vhff-1.phpt
+++ b/ext/ldap/tests/GHSA-g665-fm4p-vhff-1.phpt
@@ -24,5 +24,5 @@ try {
 }
 ?>
 --EXPECT--
-ldap_escape(): Argument #1 ($value) is too long
-ldap_escape(): Argument #1 ($value) is too long
+Argument #1 ($value) is too long
+Argument #1 ($value) is too long
diff --git a/ext/ldap/tests/GHSA-g665-fm4p-vhff-2.phpt b/ext/ldap/tests/GHSA-g665-fm4p-vhff-2.phpt
index 5c1b0fb..c774cc8 100644
--- a/ext/ldap/tests/GHSA-g665-fm4p-vhff-2.phpt
+++ b/ext/ldap/tests/GHSA-g665-fm4p-vhff-2.phpt
@@ -25,5 +25,5 @@ try {
 }
 ?>
 --EXPECT--
-ldap_escape(): Argument #1 ($value) is too long
-ldap_escape(): Argument #1 ($value) is too long
+Argument #1 ($value) is too long
+Argument #1 ($value) is too long
